-- Team bank pages of the mod BetterQoL (BetterQoL's old DLL, feature team_banks; docs/game/mechanics/team-squads-extended.md
-- section 6.4). N pages x 11 team docks (N = [team_banks] pages of BetterQoL's config.toml, default 10). Needs the
-- plugin (CMND_BETTERQOL_TEAMBANK_*, module mask bit 2097152); without it (or on save slot 1, or in a blocked game mode such
-- as story) the menu is retail.
-- R3 on a pad / N on the keyboard (CMD_FUNC6), with the cursor on anything of the dock (dock list, team name, formation,
-- kit, tactics, a player card), opens the retail "PLANTILLA DE EQUIPO" dock list
-- (sub_window type 2, the one Partido libre uses to change the active team). Inside it L2 / R2 (Q / E) page through
-- the pages: the plugin mounts the next page and the open list's rows are drawn again from it, with no close or fade.
-- Choosing a row keeps that page mounted and shows that dock; Back mounts the page you started from again and closes.
-- Under the window's title the pager «L2 • • • R2» shows the pages: a menu event to the sub window's own script
-- (BetterQoL's lua\sub_window_group\150_team_bank_pager.lua), which also redraws the rows on a page turn.
-- The window's title and the screen title stay the retail ones.
--
